      "id": "sol.ahsme-1965-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(2^{-2}=\\frac{1}{4},\\) \\[ \\begin{aligned} 81^{-(2^{-2})} &=81^{-\\frac{1}{4}}\\\\ &=(3^4)^{-\\frac{1}{4}}=\\frac13. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.",
